                <pb facs="0684" n="604" sameAs="frus:frus1902/pg604"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Powell to Mr. Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Port au Prince</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1902-06-27"><hi rendition="#italic">June 27,
                        1902</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Powell reports the receipt of a telegram from Consul Livingston that the
                    Haitian admiral intends to bombard Cape Haitian at 2 o’clock, June 28.)</p>
            </div>
